{"schemaVersion":1,"storyId":"drip-the-raindrop","version":1,"title":"Drip the Raindrop","ageTiers":["5-6","7-8"],"language":"en","narrationLocale":"en-GH","pages":[{"n":1,"text":"Drip was a tiny drop of water. She lived in the big blue sea with millions of other drops. ‘It is warm today,’ said Drip.","sentences":["Drip was a tiny drop of water.","She lived in the big blue sea with millions of other drops.","‘It is warm today,’ said Drip."],"alt":"A small blue drop with a happy face floats in the sea.","image":{"hash":"sha256:abb850f29f0277e1f72b4af1cb5e0793b3e5dd97cf0020d5c3d25de4b9c32c1e","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:b8fa0c2044c08c04e1dfa1882cabdf9248fef5b5296f19cbcc945d7fcd504976","durationMs":14560,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3733],[3733,10884],[10884,14560]],"words":[[0,570],[570,997],[997,1140],[1140,1710],[1710,2279],[2279,2564],[2564,3733],[3733,4160],[4160,4872],[4872,5157],[5157,5585],[5585,6012],[6012,6582],[6582,7009],[7009,7579],[7579,8719],[8719,9004],[9004,9716],[9716,10884],[10884,11169],[11169,11454],[11454,12024],[12024,12964],[12964,13534],[13534,14560]]}}},{"n":2,"text":"The sun shone down on the sea. Drip felt very warm. She turned into a tiny, invisible puff and floated up, up, up into the sky.","sentences":["The sun shone down on the sea.","Drip felt very warm.","She turned into a tiny, invisible puff and floated up, up, up into the sky."],"alt":"A drop rises from the sea in sunlight as an invisible puff.","image":{"hash":"sha256:5ecdf720de834ee715660f9371a886e4453e5a1242f548f164aeba5efa7b9d88","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:b5d96220b7523959263b946ae0ce844cd4b3b1c1d3688b945c434ec6d8976f19","durationMs":17720,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4205],[4205,7287],[7287,17720]],"words":[[0,482],[482,963],[963,1766],[1766,2408],[2408,2729],[2729,3210],[3210,4205],[4205,4847],[4847,5489],[5489,6131],[6131,7287],[7287,7769],[7769,8732],[8732,9374],[9374,9534],[9534,10433],[10433,11878],[11878,12520],[12520,13001],[13001,14125],[14125,14702],[14702,15280],[15280,15601],[15601,16243],[16243,16725],[16725,17720]]}}},{"n":3,"text":"High in the sky, it was cold. Drip met other puffs. They all turned back into tiny drops and held hands. Together they made a cloud.","sentences":["High in the sky, it was cold.","Drip met other puffs.","They all turned back into tiny drops and held hands.","Together they made a cloud."],"alt":"Many tiny drops gather to make a cloud high in the sky.","image":{"hash":"sha256:d2eb49fdc1fabee1a898fb2b0f51ecf99b0153ae1ec1d1789d2380ce6f5a09f1","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:634a802fa754d4581e5d858a8d48b1647fe4d732944af0df9c7d6a7b176cf166","durationMs":17880,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3963],[3963,7066],[7066,14009],[14009,17880]],"words":[[0,614],[614,922],[922,1382],[1382,2089],[2089,2396],[2396,2857],[2857,3963],[3963,4578],[4578,5038],[5038,5806],[5806,7066],[7066,7680],[7680,8141],[8141,9063],[9063,9677],[9677,10292],[10292,10906],[10906,11674],[11674,12135],[12135,12749],[12749,14009],[14009,15238],[15238,15852],[15852,16467],[16467,16620],[16620,17880]]}}},{"n":4,"text":"The cloud grew heavy. Rumble, rumble! Drip and her friends fell down as rain. ‘Splash!’ cried Drip.","sentences":["The cloud grew heavy.","Rumble, rumble!","Drip and her friends fell down as rain.","‘Splash!’ cried Drip."],"alt":"Raindrops fall from a dark cloud onto green hills.","image":{"hash":"sha256:d705d726d7d9c15cd8800d2ba7ebad6859cf5ea317430784f9bd7a8b8d45e5b2","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:2fea5151ec3ff6722272e8ab5ad7b9042bea29e35b21ba9e386988dec2cd9161","durationMs":12760,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,2783],[2783,5098],[5098,9811],[9811,12760]],"words":[[0,413],[413,1102],[1102,1654],[1654,2783],[2783,3831],[3831,5098],[5098,5650],[5650,6063],[6063,6476],[6476,7441],[7441,7992],[7992,8543],[8543,8819],[8819,9811],[9811,11079],[11079,11768],[11768,12760]]}}},{"n":5,"text":"Drip landed on a farm. The farmer smiled. The rain gave water to the maize and the beans. ‘Thank you, rain!’ said the farmer.","sentences":["Drip landed on a farm.","The farmer smiled.","The rain gave water to the maize and the beans.","‘Thank you, rain!’ said the farmer."],"alt":"A farmer smiles as rain falls on a field of maize and beans.","image":{"hash":"sha256:23d08140de15ef7b87bc3f806645bc32ff25a9f9b1a5c384b6912d09a40bf348","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:4e8a6d5f15173656947e6f3914793e19546c370551a52044248a0a85d9e40029","durationMs":15560,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,2816],[2816,5354],[5354,10959],[10959,15560]],"words":[[0,558],[558,1394],[1394,1673],[1673,1813],[1813,2816],[2816,3235],[3235,4071],[4071,5354],[5354,5772],[5772,6330],[6330,6888],[6888,7585],[7585,7864],[7864,8282],[8282,8979],[8979,9397],[9397,9816],[9816,10959],[10959,11656],[11656,12297],[12297,13301],[13301,13859],[13859,14277],[14277,15560]]}}},{"n":6,"text":"Some water ran into a stream, and the stream ran into a river. Drip rode along the river. She passed fish, reeds and a village.","sentences":["Some water ran into a stream, and the stream ran into a river.","Drip rode along the river.","She passed fish, reeds and a village."],"alt":"A raindrop rides along a river past reeds and a village.","image":{"hash":"sha256:cfaa91d4e15d35350e76984ba6f4032a0d6cb5b8bd863dcb0253723f1e64fd30","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:aad03695f11f14c3ddadbaa75d14ebb3aa179d7155eb9740e9e91d19d4a0d6eb","durationMs":15960,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,7605],[7605,11091],[11091,15960]],"words":[[0,576],[576,1296],[1296,1729],[1729,2305],[2305,2449],[2449,3543],[3543,3976],[3976,4408],[4408,5272],[5272,5704],[5704,6280],[6280,6424],[6424,7605],[7605,8182],[8182,8758],[8758,9478],[9478,9910],[9910,11091],[11091,11523],[11523,12388],[12388,13194],[13194,13915],[13915,14347],[14347,14491],[14491,15960]]}}},{"n":7,"text":"The river went on and on until it reached the big blue sea. ‘I am home!’ said Drip. She was ready to go again.","sentences":["The river went on and on until it reached the big blue sea.","‘I am home!’ said Drip.","She was ready to go again."],"alt":"A raindrop reaches the sea at the river’s mouth in the evening.","image":{"hash":"sha256:0cc8f74ccebfb6caa395fd9fbbee742cdf39d322b4391f92fc958a6f973f0a60","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:880458b3c87e57602db3f13432716104857b4526ad0a542ab1e9edcf1a1461a8","durationMs":15280,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,8015],[8015,11501],[11501,15280]],"words":[[0,489],[489,1303],[1303,1955],[1955,2281],[2281,2769],[2769,3095],[3095,3910],[3910,4235],[4235,5376],[5376,5864],[5864,6353],[6353,7005],[7005,8015],[8015,8178],[8178,8503],[8503,9676],[9676,10328],[10328,11501],[11501,11989],[11989,12478],[12478,13293],[13293,13618],[13618,13944],[13944,15280]]}}},{"n":8,"text":"The sun shone, and Drip floated up again. Water goes round and round. We call it the water cycle. The end.","sentences":["The sun shone, and Drip floated up again.","Water goes round and round.","We call it the water cycle.","The end."],"alt":"A drawing of the water cycle shows the sea, the sun, a cloud, rain and a river.","image":{"hash":"sha256:4ded2ad3c87172e8403fdc24defa620e10720ced80b4ca3210211cb4d097f4cc","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:b632dc15e1c6bbf68ef0cd16b06afb1bd6e595e6f78b0181d123f61b290a6df8","durationMs":16920,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,6527],[6527,10996],[10996,15288],[15288,16920]],"words":[[0,532],[532,1064],[1064,2235],[2235,2767],[2767,3476],[3476,4718],[4718,5072],[5072,6527],[6527,7414],[7414,8123],[8123,9010],[9010,9542],[9542,10996],[10996,11351],[11351,12060],[12060,12415],[12415,12947],[12947,13834],[13834,15288],[15288,15820],[15820,16920]]}}}],"activities":[{"id":"drip-c1","type":"comprehension","afterPage":2,"question":"What warmed Drip and made her float up?","options":["The sun","The moon","The wind"],"correctIndex":0},{"id":"drip-c2","type":"comprehension","afterPage":5,"question":"Where did the rain give water to the maize and beans?","options":["On a farm","In a shop","On a road"],"correctIndex":0},{"id":"drip-ph","type":"phonics","afterPage":6,"targetSound":"r","prompt":"Which words start with the r sound, like rain?","options":["rain","river","sun","rumble"],"correctIndexes":[0,1,3]},{"id":"drip-s1","type":"sequencing","prompt":"Put Drip’s journey in order.","items":["Drip floated up from the sea.","Drip joined a cloud.","Drip fell as rain.","Drip ran down the river to the sea."]},{"id":"drip-sel","type":"sel","afterPage":8,"prompt":"Drip went on a long journey and came home. How do you feel at the end of a journey?","feelingOptions":["Tired","Happy","Proud","Curious"]}],"glossary":[{"word":"invisible","definition":"Too small or clear to be seen.","pages":[2]},{"word":"cloud","definition":"A large white or grey mass of tiny water drops in the sky.","pages":[3,4]},{"word":"river","definition":"A large stream of water that flows to the sea.","pages":[6,7]},{"word":"cycle","definition":"Something that goes round and round in the same order.","pages":[8]}],"assets":{"sha256:abb850f29f0277e1f72b4af1cb5e0793b3e5dd97cf0020d5c3d25de4b9c32c1e":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/candidates/drip-the-raindrop/page1-1.webp","bytes":147920,"type":"image/webp"},"sha256:b8fa0c2044c08c04e1dfa1882cabdf9248fef5b5296f19cbcc945d7fcd504976":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/b8fa0c2044c0.mp3","bytes":117164,"type":"audio/mpeg"},"sha256:5ecdf720de834ee715660f9371a886e4453e5a1242f548f164aeba5efa7b9d88":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/candidates/drip-the-raindrop/page2-1.webp","bytes":1